NativeSupporterVault::finalizeRecovery
├── Given unauthorized caller, wrong state, outstanding basis or custody shortage
│   └── It cannot sweep any live claim reserve
└── Given all liabilities closed
    ├── It never rewards the last claimant with rounding dust
    ├── It separates authenticated repair-overfunding refund from donated original carry/surplus
    └── It finalizes once and atomically credits the fixed manager's remaining yield inventory
